WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Look carefully. There are three pieces, but the green piece is much bigger than each pale piece.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:23.000
We cannot call this one third just because one of three pieces is green. The pieces are not equal.

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The green piece covers half the whole strip. The two pale pieces together cover the other half.

4
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Split the big green piece into two equal pieces. Now all four pieces have the same size.

5
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Two of four equal pieces are green. Two quarters cover the same amount as one half.
